---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ChipLink from '../components/ChipLink.astro';
import Socials from '../components/Socials.astro';
import FeaturedThreads from '../components/FeaturedThreads.astro';
import { orgs } from '../data/profile';

const { keybank, kualia } = orgs;
---

<Base>
  <main id="main" class="wrap">
    <header class="head">
      <h1 class="name">Igor Amidzic</h1>
      <p class="role">Software engineer &amp; founder · Tampa, Florida</p>
    </header>

    <article class="prose">
      <p>
        I'm a senior software engineer with a decade of experience across the
        full stack, strongest on the frontend in <strong>TypeScript</strong> and
        <strong>Angular</strong>, with <strong>React</strong> in the mix lately.
        Over the last year I've gradually shifted from writing every line by hand
        to building apps primarily with Claude Code. Leaning on my engineering
        experience, I spend less time on the exact syntax of a given framework
        like React and more time mapping the frontend concepts that carry across
        all of them, then using that to keep the agent headed in the right
        direction.
      </p>

      <p>
        That workflow runs on <strong>Claude Code</strong>, my daily driver,
        which I prompt by voice with <strong>WisprFlow</strong> to get past the
        typing-speed bottleneck. I've put real work into sharpening how I prompt,
        which has roughly 10x'd my output while keeping code quality around a
        self-proclaimed 90% of what I'd write by hand.
      </p>

      <p>
        Today I'm a senior frontend engineer at <ChipLink
          href={`/${keybank.slug}`}
          label={keybank.label}
          logo={keybank.logo}
        />, where I joined a greenfield platform on day one and helped grow it
        into a tool now used by 1,500+ bankers across the country. At this large bank,
        AI tools are still new and slow to become available. We're stuck using lower quality models
        from Gemini.
      </p>

      <p>
        On my own time I founded and run <ChipLink
          href={`/${kualia.slug}`}
          label={kualia.label}
          logo={kualia.logo}
        />, a budgeting app for iPhone and web that I designed, built, and
        shipped entirely myself, from the interface down to the system that
        powers it. I first built it in <strong>Flutter</strong> and
        <strong>Supabase</strong>, then rewrote it from scratch, 100%
        agentically with Claude Code, in <strong>SwiftUI</strong>,
        <strong>Convex</strong>, and <strong>Angular</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Let's chat.
      </p>
    </article>

    <footer class="foot">
      <Socials />
      <FeaturedThreads />
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .head {
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }
  .name {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 7vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.02;
  }
  .role {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.15rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .foot {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
</style>
